cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use AmoebaScope in your research, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "AmoebaScope: Exploration and visualization of testate amoeba ecology and paleoecology using the Neotoma Paleoecology Database"
abstract: "AmoebaScope is an interactive research platform for exploring and visualizing the ecology and paleoecology of testate amoebae. It provides tools for examining surface-sample distributions, community composition, environmental gradients, and ecological relationships using data from the Neotoma Paleoecology Database."
authors:
